Storage diagnostics utilities

Intent help: storage-diagnostics help
Mounted volume: storage-diagnostics mounted-volume --help
Cluster plan: storage-diagnostics plan performance --storage-class NAME

This image runs bounded checks against an attached volume and bounded,
non-interactive kubestr workflows through controller-owned RBAC. Read the
runbook before use:
/usr/share/breakglass/runbooks/upstream/storage-diagnostics/RUNBOOK.md
README: /usr/share/breakglass/runbooks/upstream/storage-diagnostics/README.md
Internal: /usr/share/breakglass/runbooks/internal (optional read-only mount)

Defaults: 16 MiB, 5 seconds, 5 ioping requests. Configure STORAGE_TEST_PATH
and the STORAGE_TEST_* variables for a generic mount appropriate to your pod.
Cluster workflows require POD_NAMESPACE and an immutable provider-owned
STORAGE_DEBUG_WORKLOAD_IMAGE. They never accept a user-selected command,
image, namespace, ServiceAccount, capability, or RBAC object.
Internal runbook bundles are documentation only: never source or execute them.
